<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Ɛsedalase</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɛsedalase Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɛsedalase</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɛsd</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ɛsedalase</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛsedalase ta Neɠemi ta-zɛʋɛiti ta dɛɛzu ʋelei zobogi veeni la Izilayɛle nuiti zea ga ti ɠale ma ta-yooi zu, ti ɓega ʋoluma ga li ga tiye duɔlai zu Pɛɛlese ta Ɓaɓilɔne. Ɛsedalase wola ɠaazulogɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo pelei ʋa Zeluzalɛme. Faaɠwɛ nu mɔinmɔin daaʋɛ da ga Ɛsedalase ɠa é Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛ felegɔiti kɛa ta é ti ɠaalɛ ba, naa ʋɛɛ sɛʋɛi nii ʋa tɔ ɓɔɠɔ daaseigi ba, ta Neɠemi nɔnɔi. Ni Ɛsedalase ɓɔɠɔi la ɠɛni de, kɛlɛ tanisu nu ɠila kpegi nɔ ɠa é naama zɛʋɛiti pɛ gaalɛai ba. Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ Ɛsedalase Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠaalɛɛʋɛ ba kona unnaanigɔ puunaanigɔi ma (440), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ, kɛlɛ ma zɛʋɛi ná tanigaa ɠɛɛʋɛ yeeɠɛɠalai taɠiligaa zu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛsedalase Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠa dɛɛzu ʋelei GALA ge levega la, masagi Siluse ɗa va bu, é zobogi ve Izilayɛle nuiti zea, ti ɠale ma ta-yooi zu, ta ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo ʋolu. Naa ɓalaa ɠɛni ga GALA gooi nii Zelemi boni, naa ʋilɛ fai su (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 29:10-14">Zel 29:10-14</ref></char>). Izilayɛle zili nui tanigaa ti ɠɛni ná, niiti ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai laalɔɠɔma. Ma wotii loni vɔlɔ yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa laawu, kɛlɛ gaaɓela, Izilayɛle nuiti ti zooni GALA ná-kpɔbai maaʋele ma, ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo ʋolu. Ɛsedalase loni ɓalaa Izilayɛle nuiti tuɠɔ, ti ti-ziɛ ʋeleiti maavalibo. Naa ɠɛni ga ta-minazeɠegi niinɛ vai ga ti ziɛ ga GALA ná-tɔgiti.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ʋelei Siluse zobogi veeni la Izilayɛle nuiti zea ga ti ɠale ma ta-yooi zu, ta pɛlɛyeɠeiti daaseigiti niiti ti ɠaleni ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 1:1-2:70">1:1—2:70</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ʋolu Zeluzalɛme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 3:1-6:22">3:1—6:22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ɛsedalase ɠaaɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme, naa ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei tanigaa ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 7:1-8:36">7:1—8:36</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ɛsedalase loni Izilayɛle nuiti tuɠɔ ga ta-minazeɠegi niinɛ ti yɔɠɔzu ta GALA (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EZR 9:1-10:44">9:1—10:44</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1"/>
  <para style="s">Siluse zobogi vee vai ga <optbreak/> GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:22-23">2 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 36:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1"/>Pɛɛlese masagi Siluse ná-masa fai ma ɠona mɔungi, nii a kɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ʋilɛ su, nii GALA goo wo nui Zelemi boni, é Pɛɛlese masagi Siluse yiiziɠani koozu. Naa zɛba é niima wooi ɠɛ ga sɛʋɛ, naa ʋoluma ti zeze la ná-masa zooi zu ná pɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="EZR 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2"/>«Pɛɛlese masagi Siluse wooi ɠa é ga nii: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa masa zooi kpein dɔɔʋɛ zèezu eteai zu, é botii veeʋɛ zèa ga gè GALA sei ʋɛlɛ lo bɛ Zeluzalɛme, Zuda yooi zu. <verse eid="EZR 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3"/>Wo zaama, ɓɛɛni ka ti ga ná-nuɓusɛiti? Ta-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa yɛ ti ʋa, ti liina, ti lɛ Zeluzalɛme, Zuda yooi zu, ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, nii ti dɛbizu Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZR 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ ná-nui tanigaa ti ná, ti-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ti ɓɔ ti ʋa ga walii ta zanugiti, ta anii ma zii pɛ, naa ʋɛɛ toganiiti ba, ta vebɛaniiti ti daai ɠisu Zeluzalɛme ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu.› »<verse eid="EZR 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ziɛi <optbreak/> ma ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5"/>Zuda ta Ɓɛnzamɛn ʋɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti kpein ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Levi nuiti, ta niiti kpein GALA ge puuni ti yiima, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni ga ti ɠale ma ta-yooi zu, ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZR 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6"/>Ti-zeiɲɔɠɔiti ti ɓɔni ti ʋa ga sɔɔlaiti ti ga walii, ta zanugi, ta sɔɔla ɠiligaa, sɔɔla ɓiigi ma zii pɛ, naa ʋɛɛ toganiiti ba, vebɛani ɓulukpulugiti ti la naati ba.<verse eid="EZR 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7"/>Masagi Siluse ɓɔɠɔi ɗa ɠula ga sɔɔla ɓiigiti pɛ niiti Neɓukadenɛzaal ti zeɠeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu Zeluzalɛme, é li ga tiye, é ti la ná-galagiti ta-ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="EZR 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8"/>Pɛɛlese masagi devei veeni naavolo makɛ nui Miteledate ya, naa nii pɛ feeni Zuda ɠundiɠii Sɛsɛɓasaal ya. <verse eid="EZR 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9"/>Ti-liegɔi ɠaa: zanu taza ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), ta wali laza waagila (1.000), boɠa ʋuufele maazu taaʋuugɔ (29), <verse eid="EZR 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10"/>zanu ziawɔ ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), wali ɗaawɔi ma ʋɛɛda felegɔi ɠɛ ga unnaanigɔ puugɔ (410), sɔɔlai mɔtai ɠɛni ga waagila (1.000). <verse eid="EZR 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11"/>Zanu sɔɔlai ta wali zɔɔlai kpein kpɔga ɠɛni ga waadɔɔlugɔ unnaanigɔ (5.400). Sɛsɛɓasaal liini ga ti pɛ ta-yooi zu, kula zou ʋa nuiti galesuʋɛ ma, ti zeɠe Ɓaɓilɔne, ti li Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="EZR 1:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2"/>
  <para style="s">Zuifuiti tɔɠɔiti kaa, <optbreak/> ti ɠula duɔlai zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NEH 7:4-72">Neɠemi 7:4-72</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1"/>Zuda you zɛʋɛi ma nuiti tɔɠɔiti pɛtɛ, niiti Ɓaɓilɔne masagi Neɓukadenɛzaal liini ga tiye duɔlai zu Ɓaɓilɔne, ta ti ɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme ta Zuda yooi zu, ti zei ta-laaiti su ti ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="EZR 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2"/>Nui niiti ka ti loni ti luɠɔ: Zoloɓaɓɛle, Zozuwe, Neɠemi, Selaya, Leyɛlaya, Maledosé, Ɓilisan, Misapaal, Ɓigivayi, Lewume, Ɓaana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:2"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:2">Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti tiegɔi ɠaa:<verse eid="EZR 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3"/>Paleyɔse mavofodaiti waafelegɔ ungila puulɔfela maazu felegɔ (2.172),<verse eid="EZR 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4"/>Sefatia mavofodaiti unsaʋagɔ puulɔfela maazu felegɔ (372),<verse eid="EZR 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5"/>Ala mavofodaiti undɔfela puulɔfela maazu lɔɔlugɔ (775),<verse eid="EZR 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6"/>Paɠate-Moaɓe mavofodaiti, Zozuwe ta Zoaɓe ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu waafelegɔ undɔsaʋa puugɔ maazu felegɔ (2.812),<verse eid="EZR 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7"/>Elame mavofodaiti waagila unfele puulɔɔlu maazu naanigɔ (1.254),<verse eid="EZR 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8"/>Zatu mavofodaiti untaaʋuugɔ puunaani maazu lɔɔlugɔ (945),<verse eid="EZR 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9"/>Zakayi mavofodaiti undɔfela puulɔzita (760),<verse eid="EZR 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10"/>Ɓani mavofodaiti undɔzita puunaani maazu felegɔ (642),<verse eid="EZR 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11"/>Ɓeɓayi mavofodaiti undɔzita puufele maazu saʋagɔ (623),<verse eid="EZR 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12"/>Azagade mavofodaiti waagila unfele puufele maazu felegɔ (1.222),<verse eid="EZR 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13"/>Adonikame mavofodaiti undɔzita puulɔzita maazu lɔzita (666),<verse eid="EZR 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14"/>Ɓigivayi mavofodaiti waafelegɔ puulɔɔlugɔ maazu lɔzita (2.056),<verse eid="EZR 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15"/>Adin mavofodaiti unnaani puulɔɔlu maazu naanigɔ (454),<verse eid="EZR 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16"/>Atɛɛl mavofodaiti, Ezekiase ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu puutaaʋuu maazu lɔsaʋa (98),<verse eid="EZR 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17"/>Ɓesayi mavofodaiti unsaʋagɔ puufele maazu saʋagɔ (323),<verse eid="EZR 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18"/>Yola mavofodaiti ungila puugɔ maazu felegɔ (112),<verse eid="EZR 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19"/>Ɠasume mavofodaiti unfelegɔ puufele maazu saʋagɔ (223),<verse eid="EZR 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20"/>Giɓaal mavofodaiti puutaaʋuugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (95),<verse eid="EZR 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21"/>Ɓɛteleyɛme nuiti ungila puufele maazu saʋagɔ (123),<verse eid="EZR 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22"/>Netofa nuiti puulɔɔlu maazu lɔzita (56), <verse eid="EZR 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23"/>Anatɔte nuiti ungila puufele maazu lɔsaʋa (128),<verse eid="EZR 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24"/>Azamavɛte nuiti puunaani maazu felegɔ (42),<verse eid="EZR 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25"/>Kiliyate-Yeyalime nuiti, ta Kefila nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Ɓeyelɔte nuiti ba, undɔfela puunaani maazu saʋagɔ (743),<verse eid="EZR 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26"/>Lama nuiti ta Geɓa nuiti undɔzita puufele maazu ɠila (621),<verse eid="EZR 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27"/>Mikemase nuiti ungila puufele maazu felegɔ (122),<verse eid="EZR 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28"/>Ɓetɛle nuiti ta Ayi nuiti unfelegɔ puufele maazu saʋagɔ (223),<verse eid="EZR 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29"/>Neɓo nuiti puulɔɔlu maazu felegɔ (52),<verse eid="EZR 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30"/>Magaɓise mavofodaiti ungila puulɔɔlu maazu lɔzita (156),<verse eid="EZR 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31"/>Elame zɔi mavofodaiti waagila unfele puulɔɔlu maazu naanigɔ (1.254),<verse eid="EZR 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32"/>Ɠalime mavofodaiti unsaʋagɔ puufele (320),<verse eid="EZR 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33"/>Lode, ta Ɠadide, naa ʋɛɛ Wono nuiti ba undɔfela puufele maazu lɔɔlugɔ (725),<verse eid="EZR 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34"/>Zeliko nuiti unsaʋagɔ puunaani maazu lɔɔlugɔ (345),<verse eid="EZR 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35"/>Senaa nuiti waasaʋagɔ undɔzita puusaʋagɔ (3.630).<verse eid="EZR 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti tetegi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:36">Yedaya ná-doun zunuiti, Zozuwe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu untaaʋuugɔ puulɔfela maazu saʋagɔ (973),<verse eid="EZR 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37"/>Imɛɛl mavofodaiti waagila puulɔɔlu maazu felegɔ (1.052),<verse eid="EZR 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38"/>Pasuul mavofodaiti waagila unfele puunaani maazu lɔfela (1.247),<verse eid="EZR 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39"/>Ɠalime mavofodaiti waagila puugɔ maazu lɔfela (1.017).<verse eid="EZR 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40"/>Levi nuiti tetegi zu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:40">Zozuwe ta Kadimiyɛle, ta Ɓinuwi naa ʋɛɛ Wodavia ʋa, ti-mavofodaiti puulɔfela maazu naanigɔ (74).<verse eid="EZR 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41"/>Guye loo nuiti:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:41">Azafe mavofodaiti ungila puufele maazu lɔsaʋa (128).<verse eid="EZR 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42"/>Siɠida makɛ nuiti:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:42">Salume, ta Atɛɛl, Talamɔn, ta Akuɓe, Ɠatita, ta Soɓai ti-mavofodaiti ungila puusaʋagɔ maazu taaʋuugɔ (139).<verse eid="EZR 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti ti-laaseigiti ti ʋaazu, ti-mavofodaiti:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:43">Siɠa, Ɠasufa, Taɓayɔte, <verse eid="EZR 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44"/>Kelɔse, Siaɠa, Padɔn, <verse eid="EZR 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45"/>Leɓana, Ɠagaɓa, Akuɓe, <verse eid="EZR 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46"/>Ɠagaɓe, Samelai, Ɠanan, <verse eid="EZR 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47"/>Gidɛle, Gaɠaal, Leaya, <verse eid="EZR 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48"/>Lesin, Nekoda, Gazame, <verse eid="EZR 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49"/>Uza, Paseya, Ɓesayi, <verse eid="EZR 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50"/>Asena, Meɠunime, Nefusime, <verse eid="EZR 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51"/>Ɓakeɓuke, Ɠakufa, Ɠaaleɠuul, <verse eid="EZR 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52"/>Ɓasalute, Meyida, Ɠaalesa, <verse eid="EZR 2:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53"/>Ɓaalekɔse, Sisela, Tama, <verse eid="EZR 2:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54"/>Nesiya, Ɠatifa.<verse eid="EZR 2:54"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55"/>Salomɔn ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ti-mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti ti-laaseigiti ti ʋaazu, naati ti-mavofodaiti:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:55">Sotayi, Sofelɛte, Peluda, <verse eid="EZR 2:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56"/>Yaala, Daalakon, Gidɛle, <verse eid="EZR 2:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57"/>Sefatia, Ɠatile, Pokɛlɛte-Ɠasebayime, Ami.<verse eid="EZR 2:57"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ nuiti, ta Salomɔn ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ti-mavofodaiti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu unsaʋagɔ puutaaʋuu maazu felegɔ (392).<verse eid="EZR 2:58"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59"/>Tanigaa ti zeɠeni taai niiti su ti ʋa: Tɛle-Mela, Tɛle-Yaalesa, Keluɓe-Adan, Imɛɛl, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa ta-wolodaiti dɔlɔ ta ti-mɛmɛwolani nii é dɛɛzu ga ta ga Izilayɛle nu, ti laaseigiti kaa:<verse eid="EZR 2:59"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60"/>Delaya, ta Toɓiya, ta Nekoda ti-mavofodaiti undɔzita puulɔɔlu maazu felegɔ (652).<verse eid="EZR 2:60"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ɓalaa saama, tanigaa ti ɠɛni naama ɠɛʋelei zu, naati daaseigiti kaa:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:61">Ɠaɓaya ta Akɔse naa ʋɛɛ Ɓaalazilayi ʋa, ti-mavofodaiti, gaaɓelagi naa Galaade nui Ɓaalazilayi laaseigi zeɠeni mazɔlɔɔ é naa ná-doun anzanui vuluni.<verse eid="EZR 2:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62"/>Sɛʋɛi nii ti-mɛmɛwolani daaseigi su, ti gaiziɛni, kɛlɛ ti la kaani. Naa maaʋele ma ti ti ʋɛtɛni ga ti la ɲadeni, ti la ɠɛni vaani bu, naati ti ʋa boti nɔpɛ kɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZR 2:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ɓɔɠɔgoi ti leveni ga ti mina daamianigi naa ta mi, niiti ti veai GALA bɛ, eyɛsu zalaɠa ɠula nui gila ge GALA gaazaɠa ta-vaa zu ga wuulimegi ta tumimegi.<verse eid="EZR 2:63"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64"/>Bɛbɛi pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuunaanigɔ maazu felegɔ unsaʋagɔ puulɔzita (42.360). <verse eid="EZR 2:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65"/>Ta-wotiɠɛ nuiti, zinaa ta anzaa, ti ɠɛni ga nu waadɔfela unsaʋagɔ puusaʋa maazu lɔfela (7.337). Guye loo nuiti, zinaa ta anzaa, naati ti ɠɛ ga unfelegɔ (200). <verse eid="EZR 2:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66"/>Sooi ɠɛni ti ya ga undɔfela puusaʋagɔ maazu lɔzita (736), soovale fuului ɠɛ ti ya ga unfelegɔ puunaani maazu lɔɔlugɔ (245). <verse eid="EZR 2:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67"/>Ɲɔmɛi ɠɛni ga unnaanigɔ puusaʋagɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (435), soovalegi ɠɛ ga waadɔzita undɔfela puufele (6.720).<verse eid="EZR 2:67"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68"/>Ti zeeliai ma Zeluzalɛme, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ná-taazuʋɛ, pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠii ma mɔinmɔin ti vebɛaniiti feeni, niiti ti daai ɠisu, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu, tosu wɔlɔmai. <verse eid="EZR 2:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69"/>Ti ti zooda vai ɠɛɛni ga naavoloi pɛlɛi lo fai zu. Nii ti kulani, naa liini ga zanu kae waaʋuulɔzita maazu ɠila (61.000), ta wali kilo waafelegɔ undɔɔlu (2.500). Ti tookɔba ungila (100) feeni ɓalaa ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta-zeɠeiti.<verse eid="EZR 2:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, ta Levi nuiti, ta nuɓusɛi tanigaa, ta guye loo nuiti, ta siɠida makɛ nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ nuiti ba, ti zeini taai naati su, ʋɛti ti náti feeni ti ya. Nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti ti zeini ta-laa wɔlɔmaiti su.<verse eid="EZR 2:70"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3"/>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ lo fai ʋolu, <optbreak/> GALA dɛbi vai lɔɔzei ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1"/>Konagi ma alugi lɔfelasiɛi zeeliai ma, Izilayɛle nuiti kpein ti ɠɛnina zeini ta-laazuʋɛti, ti pɛ ti ɠaalɛɛni ba Zeluzalɛme eɠɛ nu ɠila nɔ. <verse eid="EZR 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2"/>Yosadake ná-doun zunui Zozuwe, ta bɔɔla zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui Zoloɓaɓɛle ʋa, ta ná-bolodamaiti, ti botii lɔɔzeini, ti ɗa GALA ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ lo ʋolu, nii a kɛ ti ɗa gala zalaɠaiti kula ná, ʋelei sɛʋɛai la Moize ná-tɔ sɛʋɛi zu, GALA ná-nui. <verse eid="EZR 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3"/>Anɛɛ ni ti ɠɛni luazu nui naati ba ti ʋaani, ti zei zooi zu, ti ɠɛai ma duɔlai zu, ti zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ loni tosu wɔlɔmai nɔ, ti ɗa gala zalaɠaiti kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, sobui ta kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="EZR 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4"/>Ti kota vɛtii ɠulani, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la, ti ɗa gala zalaɠai ɠula folo-o-folo, é zoloo zalaɠai liegi ma nii sɛʋɛai folo ɠilagilagi vaa ma. <verse eid="EZR 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5"/>Naa ʋoluma, ti gala zalaɠai ɠulani folo-o-folo, ta alu toga niinɛi ma vɛti geleiti, ta yeeɠɛɠalai zɔiti pɛ su geleiti ti ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ, naa ʋɛɛ niiti kpein ba ti ɠɛɛni vebɛaniiti feezu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZR 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6"/>Alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo mɔungi, ti tɔɔzeini ga ti ɗa gala zalaɠaiti kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, anɛɛ ni ti la ɠɛni dɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠɔtu mɔungiti daani. <verse eid="EZR 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7"/>Ti walii veeni kɔtu zaɠa nuiti zea, ta pɛlɛ maalɛɛ nuiti, ti daamianigiti ta kpɔleɓɔle ganigiti ta gulɔi ve Sidɔn ta Tiil nuiti zea, nii a kɛ ti sɛdele gului zeɠe Liɓan, ti da kpoloɗɛi ɠa, ti ʋaa la Zafa. Nii pɛ ge ɠɛɛni ga zobogi maaʋele, nii Pɛɛlese masagi Siluse feeni.<verse eid="EZR 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8"/>Ti zeeliai ma Zeluzalɛme, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma laazuʋɛ, ta-ɠonagi velesiɛi ta alugi velesiɛi ma, Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui Zoloɓaɓɛle, Yosadake ná-doun zunui Zozuwe ta bɔɔla zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, ta Levi nuiti, é ʋɛɛ niiti kpein ba ti zeɠeni duɔla ʋelei zu, ti ʋa, ti tɔɔzeini ga botii ɠɛa. Ti yeeloni Levi nuɓusɛiti ba, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, ga ti lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai luɠɔ. <verse eid="EZR 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9"/>Levi nui Zozuwe ta ná-doun zunuiti, ta kɛɛɠɛlointi, naa ʋɛɛ Kadimiyɛle ʋa, ta ná-doun zunuiti, ta kɛɛɠɛlointi, Wodavia ná-bolodamaiti su, ta Levi nui niiti ti ga Ɠenadade ná-bolodamaiti, ti pɛ ti loni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma wotiɠɛ nuiti tuɠɔ.<verse eid="EZR 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10"/>Pɛlɛ lo nuiti ti ɠɛai ma GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma zeɓasemai laazu, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti ʋaani ʋelelaʋɛ, ti maaɠiliai ga ta-zalaɠa ɠula zeɠeiti, puʋugi ti ya, Levi nui Azafe mavofodaiti ti ʋa ga kɔtɛgiti, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la Davide ʋɛ, Izilayɛle masagi. <verse eid="EZR 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11"/>Ti ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbizu, ti ɗa maamusɛ ga pilima wuyei, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋagɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ Izilayɛle ʋɛ!» Nuɓusɛiti ɓalaa ti ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbizu ga koozunɛ woo wolaiti, tɔɔzei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma zeɓasemai laa vai ʋa. <verse eid="EZR 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12"/>Nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ná, niiti ti ɠɛni ga kɛwolaiti zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, ta Levi nuiti, ta pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti saama, ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛ mɔungi ɠaani, naati ti ɠɛni wɔlɔzu ga gola, siɛgi zu GALA sei ʋɛlɛ niinɛi ma zeɓasemai ɠɛni laazu la ti ɠaazu. Kɛlɛ nu mɔinmɔin kiligaa ti ɠɛni ta-ɠoozunɛɛi ɠulazu kɛlɛma ga kpee woo wolaiti. <verse eid="EZR 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13"/>Tɔ ɠa é ba nu la ɠɛni zooga è ʋa nuiti goo yɔɠɔzuɠula, niiti ti wɔlɔzu, ta niiti ti wooɠulazu ga koozunɛɛi, mazɔlɔɔ ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni kpee wolai loozu, nu ɗa ti woomɛni ɠoozama.<verse eid="EZR 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai <optbreak/> ɓela fai pele zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1"/>Nui niiti ti ɠɛni zooi zu, ti ga Zuda ta Ɓɛnzamɛn ti zili nuiti, ti mɛnini ga naati ti ɠulani kpein duɔlai zu, ta ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI. <verse eid="EZR 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2"/>Ti ʋaani Zoloɓaɓɛle ʋɔ bɛ ta pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «Gá pɔ gi ɓɔ wo ʋa, ade GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nii lo. Mazɔlɔɔ GALA gilagi naa nɔ ɠa gá ɗa dɛbi, gi ɗa zalaɠaiti kula bɛ, é zo yee nuu ma Asiili masagi Ezaal-Ɠadon ʋaani la ga giye ʋɛ.» <verse eid="EZR 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3"/>Kɛlɛ Zoloɓaɓɛle ta Zozuwe, naa ʋɛɛ pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti ba, ti ti wooɠaaʋoteni ga: «É la zolooni ga wo ɓɔ gi ʋa, ade GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo gá-ƓALAGI ʋɛ. Gá ɠila nɔ ɠa gi kɛɛzu, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɠɛɛzu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI. Pɛɛlese Masagi Siluse ɓɔɠɔi ɠa é deveni ɠani.»<verse eid="EZR 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4"/>Zooi zu nui naati ti tɔɔzeini ga Zuda nuɓusɛiti iɲɔteʋea, ta ti ɗa naati maalua, nii a kɛ ti looɠo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ʋa. <verse eid="EZR 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5"/>Ti ɠɛni walii veezu masagi ná-botiɠɛ nuiti zea ga ti Zuda nuiti ta-wotii zuɠoloɠolo, naa ɠa ti yɛni daawu Pɛɛlese masagi Siluse ná-masa fai ma ziɛgi pɛ su, eyɛsu é zeeli Daliyuse nɔnɔi ma.<verse eid="EZR 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuifuiti maalɔɔ vai <optbreak/> masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6"/>Zɛɛlesɛse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zɛɛlesɛse</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: É ɠɛni ga Pɛɛlese masagi niima ɠonagiti su: 486-464 aisa Yesu Kilista zɔlɔɔ.</char></note> ná-masa fai lɔɔzei ziɛgi zu, ti sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni, ti teʋe ma, ti Zeluzalɛme zei wo nuiti ta Zuda you zɛʋɛi ma nuiti maalɔɔ su.<verse eid="EZR 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7"/>Siɛgi zu Aaletazɛɛlesɛse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Aaletazɛɛlesɛse</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: É ɠɛni ga Pɛɛlese masagi niima ɠonagiti su: 464-424 aisa Yesu Kilista zɔlɔɔ.</char></note> ɠɛni la ga Pɛɛlese masagi, Ɓisilame, ta Miteledate, naa ʋɛɛ Taɓeyɛle ʋa, ta ti-wɔɔlaiti ti sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni masagi ma, ti kɛɛni ga Alame zɛʋɛi ta Alame wooi zu. <verse eid="EZR 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Lewume ta sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui Simesai ti sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni tiya ɓalaa masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ma, é ʋilɛ Zeluzalɛme ʋa, sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeini ɠani:<verse eid="EZR 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9"/>Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Lewume, ta sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui Simesai, ta ti-wɔɔlai mɔtaiti niiti ti ga Din nuiti, ta Afalasatake nuiti, Taalepɛle nuiti, Afalase nuiti, Ɠeelɛke nuiti, Ɓaɓilɔne ta Suze nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Deɠa ta Elame nuiti ba. <verse eid="EZR 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10"/>Nuɓusɛi mɔtai pɛ daaseigi zu, niiti lɔɠɔɠula nu wolai Wosenapaal ʋaani ga tiye, é ti zei Samali laa wolaiti su, ta ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei, ta mɔtaiti. <verse eid="EZR 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11"/>Sɛʋɛi zu wooi ɠɛni ga nii:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 4:11">«Sɛʋɛi nii ɠa liizu masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ma, é ɠula ná-botiɠɛ nuiti zea, ti ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei, ta mɔtaiti. <verse eid="EZR 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12"/>Masagi, gá bosu è ma ga Zuifui niiti ti zeɠeai è ʋɔ bɛ, ti ʋa gi zaama Zeluzalɛme, ta ga taa ɲɔi é ga gaazulɛɛ laai lo ʋolu, ti ɓega ʋoluma ga seɓasemaiti da, ta ga ma ziɠigiti buzeɠe. <verse eid="EZR 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13"/>Tama kɛni masagi è kwɛɛ ga ni taai tɛi ka lona ʋolu, ma ziɠigiti ti wuzeɠe ʋolu, ti la mɔ zou zalai ta maazoloo ganii ɠula, ta zou maaleʋe salai, naama zeeʋo ka yɛ masagi ná-naavolo vaiti ba. <verse eid="EZR 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14"/>Gɛi gi undaanɛ zɔlɔɔgai ga gi botii ɠɛ è ʋɛ, gi la zooga gi ʋa yɛ wɛlɛzu, ti ʋa ɗa è ʋɛlɛlala, gi deveʋɛ ga gi è loo ɠisu ga niima vaiti. <verse eid="EZR 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15"/>Wɛlɛ masa pɔlɔmaiti ta-zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmaiti su, niiti ti ɠɛa è luɠɔ. Ɗa pɛtɛ ga gaamazu kaite taai nii ɠa ga gaazulɛɛ laai, ta é la looɠoni ga zou masagiti ta zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti kpɔlɔa, ta kaite taai nii zu ɠa nɔ wuulee ga kpaka faiti. Naa nɔ ɠa é kɛai ɓalaa ma taai ɠoloɠologai. <verse eid="EZR 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16"/>Gá pɔ gi è loo ɠisu, masagi, ga ni taai nii a lona ʋolu, ma ziɠigiti ti wuzeɠe ʋolu, è leve la mɔ ɠɛa ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei ma.»<verse eid="EZR 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masagi ná-gooɠaaʋotegi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17"/>Masagi gooɠaaʋotegi ɠɛni ga nii é teʋeni: «Ɗɛi è ga zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Lewume, ta sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui Simesai, naa ʋɛɛ ti zeini Samali ta wɔi wo ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei ma yooi mɔtai pɛ su, nà wo luʋɔsu. <verse eid="EZR 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18"/>Sɛʋɛi nii wo teʋegai, ti kalagɛ gàazu. <verse eid="EZR 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19"/>Gè devei veeʋɛ ga ti wɛlɛ sɛʋɛiti su, tama ti kaaʋɛ ga gaamazu kaite, Zeluzalɛme ɠa ga taai nii é ga gaazulɛɛ laai masagiti daalɔɠɔma, ta kaite gaazulɛɛi ta kpaka faiti ta ná. <verse eid="EZR 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20"/>Masagaa ti ɠɛa Zeluzalɛme, ti-zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔai, niiti ti zeini ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei yooiti kpein unga, naati ti ɗa zou zalai ta maazoloo ganii ve ti ya, ta zou maaleʋe salai. <verse eid="EZR 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21"/>Tɔ ɠa é ba à bo ti ma ti botii ɓela pele zu, ti mina taai naa lo, ni gè la deve veeni. <verse eid="EZR 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22"/>À mina naama vai la ɠoba, faa ɲɔi ʋa wɔɔlɔ, zeeʋo ge ʋa yɛ masagiti ba.»<verse eid="EZR 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23"/>Tɛi feya ti masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ná-sɛʋɛi zu wooi mɛnini, Lewume ta sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui Simesai ta ti-wɔɔlaiti ti liini ga gaazuvilɛ Zuifuiti pɔ bɛ Zeluzalɛme, ti naati ta-wotii ɓela pele zu ga toomai ta maaɓaai.<verse eid="EZR 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24"/>Ʋele ɠana GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ɓelani la pele zu Zeluzalɛme, eyɛsu Pɛɛlese masagi Daliyuse ná-masadai ma ɠonagi velesiɛi ma.<verse eid="EZR 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai <optbreak/> lɔɔzei vai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1"/>GALA goo wo nuiti Azé<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 1:1">Azé 1:1</ref></char>.</note> ta Zakali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Zkl 1:1</ref></char>.</note>, Ido ná-doun zunui, ti ɓɔɛni Zuifuiti pɔ Zuda yooi zu ta Zeluzalɛme ga GALA daawooi, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI. <verse eid="EZR 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2"/>Zoloɓaɓɛle, Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui, ta Zozuwe, Yosadake ná-doun zunui, ti wuzeɠe ʋele ɠana, ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai lɔɔzei Zeluzalɛme, GALA goo wo nuiti ti ɗa ɓɔ ti ʋa.<verse eid="EZR 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3"/>Gaamago nɔ, Tatenayi nii é ɠɛni ga zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei pɛ unda, ta Setaal-Ɓozinayi, é ʋɛɛ ti-wɔɔlaiti pɛ ba, ti liini ti ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é niima levei vea wo ya ga wo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nii lo ʋolu, wo ma ziɠigiti niinɛ? <verse eid="EZR 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4"/>Nuiti kpein ti niima ʋɛlɛi losu, à ti pɛ daaseigiti fe gi ya.» <verse eid="EZR 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge ɓaani Zuifuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti maazu. Nu la ta-wotii loni pele zu, eyɛsu sɛʋɛ zeeli Daliyuse ma, ta é ná-gooɠaaʋotegi ve é ʋilɛ niima vai ʋa.<verse eid="EZR 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ti Zuifuiti maalɔ vai <optbreak/> masagi Daliyuse ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6"/>Wɛlɛ sɛʋɛi zu wooi ʋa, nii é leʋeni masagi Daliyuse ma, é ɠula Tatenayi ya, nii é ɠɛni ga zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei pɛ unda, ta Setaal-Ɓozinayi, é ʋɛɛ ti-wɔɔlaiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="EZR 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7"/>Ʋele ɠaa ti ɓɔɛni la ta-zɛʋɛi zu:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 5:7">«Masagi Daliyuse, ziilɛi daazeeliai ɠɛ è ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZR 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8"/>Masagi, gá bosu è ma ga gi liiʋɛ Zuda you zɛʋɛi ma, gi zeeli GALA golai zei ʋɛlɛi ʋɔ bɛ. Nuiti ta ga pɛlɛi naa lo ga kɔtu zaɠaai, ti ɗa guluiti dɔ ma ziɠigiti su, ti zɛbɛzeɠeʋɛ botii zu, é ɗa zoloo ti ya. <verse eid="EZR 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9"/>Gi kundiɠiiti gaazaɠagɛ, gi ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa é niima levei vea wo ya ga wo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nii lo ʋolu, wo ma ziɠigiti niinɛ?› <verse eid="EZR 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10"/>Gi ɠɛɛʋɛ ti ma ɓalaa, niiti kpein ti unda, ti naati kpein daaseigiti sɛʋɛ, ti fe gi ya. <verse eid="EZR 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11"/>Ti gi wooɠaaʋotegɛ ga: ‹GALAGI nii é geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ɓɛtɛa, naa ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ka ga giye, gá sei ʋɛlɛi nii losu ʋolu, nii Izilayɛle masa golai gila ge toni kaite, é gaaɓela. <verse eid="EZR 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12"/>Kɛlɛ gi-mɛmɛwolani ti geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛ ƓALAGI yiiɠaawanaai ma, naa ti ɠwɛɛni Neɓukadenɛzaal ma, Ɓaɓilɔne masagi, Kaledé nui, tɔ ɠa é GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nii ɠoloni, é li ga tiye duɔlai zu Ɓaɓilɔne. <verse eid="EZR 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13"/>Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, Ɓaɓilɔne masagi Siluse ná-kona mɔungi ma, é devei veeni ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nii lo ʋolu. <verse eid="EZR 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14"/>Masagi Siluse ɓɔɠɔi devei veeni ga sɔɔlai niiti kpein ti ɓɛtɛai ga zanugi ta walii, niiti Neɓukadenɛzaal ti ɠulani GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu Zeluzalɛme, é li ga tiye, é ti la ná-galagi ná-pɛlɛi wu Ɓaɓilɔne, ti sɔɔlai naati feeni Sɛsɛɓasaal ya, nii tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é kɛɛni ga Zuda you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii. <verse eid="EZR 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15"/>É valini ma ga: Li ga sɔɔlai niiti. Siɛgi zu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɓesu la ga lo tosu wɔlɔmai Zeluzalɛme, wo ti la bu. <verse eid="EZR 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16"/>Názu ɠa Sɛsɛɓasaal ʋaa la ʋɛ Zeluzalɛme, é GALA sei ʋɛlɛ niinɛi ma zeɓasemai la. É zo naazu ma botii ɠa ba, é ɗa ɠɛ, kɛlɛ gaa la dɛ ɓelani.› <verse eid="EZR 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17"/>Niizu niina, masagi, ni ɗa kaana ga faa ʋagɔ, bo, ti wɛlɛ Ɓaɓilɔne masagiti ta-zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmaiti su, é ɠwɛɛ ni masagi Siluse deve veeni ga ɠite vaa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nii lo fai zu Zeluzalɛme, naa ʋoluma ɗa ɗa-levei lɛ ga giye niina niima vai zu.»<verse eid="EZR 5:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6"/>
  <para style="s">Daliyuse ná-gooɠaaʋotegi é feeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1"/>Naazu masagi Daliyuse devei veeni ga ti gaiziɛi wo Ɓaɓilɔne zɛʋɛiti ta ani ɓii makɛ ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="EZR 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2"/>Ɛkɛɓatane taazuʋɛ, Mɛde ɠoʋii laa wolai nii siɠigi ma, miná ɠa ti sɛʋɛ ɓiligi gila kaani ná, nii sɛʋɛi ʋɔnɛni ma ɠani:<verse eid="EZR 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3"/>«Siluse ná-kona mɔungi masa fai zu, é niima levei woni, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi maanɛɛʋɛ é lo ʋolu Zeluzalɛme, naa ɠɛ ga ʋɛ zalaɠaiti ta ɠɛ ɠulazu ná, toɠa losu tosu wɔlɔmai nɔ, gaa ɠaaɠoozazu ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), kogi ɠɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), <verse eid="EZR 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4"/>kɔtu zaɠaai ma ɲɛkpɛ saʋagɔ, gulu niinɛi ma ɲɛkpɛ ɠila. Naama walii kpein ka ɠulazu masagi ná-naavolo makɛsuʋɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5"/>Naa ʋoluma zanu sɔɔlaiti ta wali zɔɔlaiti kpein Neɓukadenɛzaal ti ɠulani GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu Zeluzalɛme, é ʋa ga tiye Ɓaɓilɔne, ti pɛ maanɛɛʋɛ ti ɠale ma, ʋɛ ti zeɠeai ná, ti la GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu Zeluzalɛme.»<verse eid="EZR 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6"/>Naa maaʋele ma, Daliyuse niima zɛʋɛi leʋeni ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Tatenayi ma, ta Setaal-Ɓozinayi, ta ti-wɔɔlaiti kpein: «À yeeɠula fai naa zu. <verse eid="EZR 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7"/>À Zuifuiti zɛna dɔin, ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo, Zuifuiti ta-you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ta ta-ɠɛwolaiti ka ti tosu, tosu wɔlɔmai. <verse eid="EZR 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8"/>Nɔ̀nɔ ma levei ɠa gè bosu, ʋelei wa ziɛ la Zuifuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti tetemazu, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu. À ɠaaɓa, pɛlɛi lo walii kpein ge ɗa ve ti ya falafala, é ɠula masagi ná-naavolo makɛsuʋɛ, nii é zɔlɔɔsu maazoloo ganii zu é ɠulazu ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei ma yooi zu, naa ɠa a kɛ botii mina lo pele zu. <verse eid="EZR 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9"/>Kɛni wo kɛ ʋele-o-ʋele, wo ɗa naa ve zalaɠa ɠula nuiti zea folo-o-folo, nii ta ɓɛdɛ ma, ti dɛɛ ga woye, é ɠɛni ga: nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpagiti, baala sinɛiti, baala ziʋoiti, gala zalaɠaiti faa zu é veezu GALAGI ʋɛ é geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Ʋele nɔ ɠana wa kɛɛ la ɓalaa é ʋilɛ moloi, kpoloi, dɔɔi ta gulɔiti ba. <verse eid="EZR 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10"/>Ta zoo naazu ti ɗa geeɠɔlɔgi zu ƓALAGI yiima zalaɠaiti kula, ti ɗa GALA fali masagi yɛnvui, ta ná-dointi zɛnvuiti ta-vaa zu. <verse eid="EZR 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11"/>Devei taɠili ka mɔnɔ gè feezu: Nu nɔpɛ é devei nii ɠoloɠolosu, ta kpɛdɛ gila kula ná-pɛlɛi wu, ti sɛlɛ ba, ná-pɛlɛi ɠa valibo ga kaʋa ziɠigi. <verse eid="EZR 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12"/>GALAGI nii é zeini Zeluzalɛme, naa masagi ɓaa zooi naa ɠoloɠolo, nii é yeewuzeɠezu é devei nii zeɠe ma, ga é GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nii ɠolo é Zeluzalɛme. Nà ɓɔɠɔi Daliyuse, nà ɠa gè devei nii vea, kɛni é ziɛ ga pagɔ.»<verse eid="EZR 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛ wotii ɠaaɓela fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13"/>Naa ʋoluma ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Tatenayi, ta Setaal-Ɓozinayi, ta ti-wɔɔlaiti kpein, ti ziɛni ga masagi Daliyuse ná-devei nɔ. <verse eid="EZR 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14"/>Zuifuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti iɲɔdɔɔi zɔlɔɔni GALA goo wo nuiti Azé ta Ido ná-doun zunui Zakali ta-lɛnɛ gooiti su, ti ɗa li luɠɔma pɛlɛ logi zu, eyɛsu ti gaaɓela, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveni la, ta eɠɛʋelei Pɛɛlese masagiti Siluse, ta Daliyuse, é ʋɛɛ Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ʋa ti deveni la. <verse eid="EZR 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɓeni alugi daa ga Adaal, naa ná-folo saʋagɔi ma, masagi Daliyuse ná-kona dɔzitasiɛi ma masa fai zu.<verse eid="EZR 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16"/>Izilayɛle nuiti, ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, ta Levi nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ nuɓusɛi mɔtai pɛ ba ti ɠulaai duɔlai zu, ti ʋa, ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laalaoni ga koozunɛɛi. <verse eid="EZR 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi naa laalao fai zu, ti zalaɠaiti kulani: nikɛ zinɛ ungila (100), baala sinɛ unfelegɔ (200), baala ziʋo unnaanigɔ (400), ta boli zinɛ puugɔ maazu fele (12) koto gba vai zu Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ bɛ, é zoloo ta-woloda puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) ma. <verse eid="EZR 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18"/>Ti zalaɠa ɠula nuiti seini su ʋelei ta-zeikpasui la, Levi nuiti ɓalaa ʋelei ta-ɠaaɠwɛsui la, GALA ná-botiɠɛ vai zu Zeluzalɛme, ʋelei sɛʋɛai la Moize ná-sɛʋɛi zu.<verse eid="EZR 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19"/>Niiti kpein ti ɠulani duɔlai zu, ti ʋa, naati ti Pake fɛtii ɠulani alu mɔungi ma volo puugɔ maazu naanigɔi (14) ma. <verse eid="EZR 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta Levi nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɲadeni ʋɔɔma, ti pɛ ti ɲadeni. Levi nuiti ti Pake suaiti kɔdaaleʋeni naazu nuɓusɛi pɛ bɛ, ti ɠulaai duɔlai zu, ta ti-ɠɛɛlointi bɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, ta tiya ɓɔɠɔi ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZR 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21"/>Izilayɛle nui niiti kpein ti ɠulaai duɔlai zu, ti ʋa, ti Pake daamii woni ʋɔɔma, ta niiti kpein ti ɓɔɠɔ ɲadeni, ti yeeɓe zii ɠiligiti ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti pɛ ba, ta ti ʋilɛ ti ʋolu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiima vai ɠɛɛ vai zu, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI. <verse eid="EZR 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22"/>Folo lɔfela laawu fɛtii ɠulani, nii ta ɗa ɓului mi su, nii lɛʋɛ la su, ti kɛɛni ga koozunɛ wolai, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Asiili masagi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asiili masagi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daliyuse, nii é ɠɛni ga Pɛɛlese masagi.</char></note> yii latini ti ma ga pagɔ, é ɓɔ ti ʋa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI.<verse eid="EZR 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛsedalase lii vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1"/>Niima vaiti kpein poluma, Pɛɛlese masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ná-siɛgi zu, zunui ta ɠɛni ná, daa ga Ɛsedalase, Selaya ná-doun zunui, mɛmɛwolani daaseigiti ta ti zɔlɔɔ peleiti kaa: Azalia, Yilikiya, <verse eid="EZR 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2"/>Salume, Sadɔke, Ayituɓe, <verse eid="EZR 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3"/>Amalia, Azalia, Melayɔte, <verse eid="EZR 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4"/>Zelayia, Uzi, Ɓuki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5"/>Aɓisua, Fineyase, Eleazaal, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Aalɔn ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="EZR 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6"/>Ɛsedalase naa zeɠeni Ɓaɓilɔne. É ɠɛni ga sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui, kalagai Moize ná-tɔgi zu, tɔgi nii Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feeni Moize ya. Masagi ɠɛni naa kpein feezu Ɛsedalase ya, nii é ɠɛni falizu ma, mazɔlɔɔ ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ba. <verse eid="EZR 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7"/>Masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ná-masadai ma ɠonagi lɔfelasiɛi ma, Izilayɛle nui tanigaa ti ɠaleni ma, ti li Zeluzalɛme: zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Levi nuiti, gɛingɛin gani gɛin nuiti, siɠida makɛ nuiti, ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ nuiti.<verse eid="EZR 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8"/>Ɛsedalase yɛni ti ʋolu, ti li Zeluzalɛme, masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ná-masadai ma ɠonagi lɔfelasiɛi ma alugi lɔɔlusiɛi ma. <verse eid="EZR 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9"/>É deveni ga é zeɠe Ɓaɓilɔne alu mɔungi ma volo mɔungi ma, é zeeli Zeluzalɛme alugi lɔɔlusiɛi ma volo mɔungi ma, ná-GALAGI zaalai zu, nii é ɠɛni tɔun makɛsu. <verse eid="EZR 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɛsedalase ɠɛni ɠaaɓaazu, é ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgi ɠala, ta é ɗa so ga yii pɛ, é ɗa Izilayɛle nuiti kala ga tɔgiti ta deveiti.<verse eid="EZR 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tosuʋɛ niiti Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ti ɠalivaani <optbreak/> Ɛsedalase ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11"/>Sɛʋɛi zu wooi ʋɛtɛ, nii Pɛɛlese masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse feeni zalaɠa ɠula nui Ɛsedalase ya, tɔgiti ta deveiti ma ɠalamɔin, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti veeni Izilayɛle nuiti zea:<verse eid="EZR 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12"/>«Aaletazɛɛlesɛse, masagiti ta-masagi, niima zɛʋɛi ɠa liizu zalaɠa ɠula nui Ɛsedalase ma, GALAGI nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, naa ná-tɔgiti ma ɠalamɔin. <verse eid="EZR 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13"/>Gè devei vea ga nu nɔpɛ Izilayɛle nuiti saama, ti nà-masa zooi zu, é ɠɛni ga zalaɠa ɠula nu, ɓaa Levi nu, é pɔ ga é li Zeluzalɛme, ti ɓe ti pɛ ba, wo li ʋɔɔma wa tiye. <verse eid="EZR 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14"/>Nɔ̀un nà, masagi, gá nà-tɛnɛbo nu lɔfelaiti ka gi è leʋesu Zeluzalɛme ta Zuda, è ka ʋelei ɗa-ƓALAGI ná-tɔgi zosu la ná, nii é è ya. <verse eid="EZR 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15"/>Siɛ ɠilagi naa nɔ zu ɗa liizu ga walii ta zanugi, nii gá nà-tɛnɛbo nuiti gi daai ɠisu ga gi fe Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ʋɛ, é zeini Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZR 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16"/>Ɗa liizu ɓalaa ga waliiti ta zanugiti, niiti ti ɠulaai nuiti zea ti Ɓaɓilɔne you zɛʋɛi zu, ta niiti nuɓusɛiti ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti daai ɠisu ga vebɛanii ta-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi vaa zu, é Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZR 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17"/>Naama walii ɠa è nikɛ zinɛiti ta baala sinɛiti ta baala ziʋoiti geyazu la ná, naa ʋɛɛ vebɛ zalaɠaiti ba ta puya zalaɠaiti, è ti pɛ kula ga zalaɠai wa-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZR 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18"/>Wa è-wɔɔla zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, nii nɔpɛ wa ka ga soloogɛ ga wo kɛ ga wali ta zanu mɔtai, à kɛɛ la, eɠɛʋelei soloogai la wa-ƓALAGI yiimai ma. <verse eid="EZR 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19"/>GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ zɔɔlai niiti ti veai è ya, li, è ti la ɗa-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZR 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20"/>Ni ani ɠili geya vaa a lona è ʋa ɗa-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi naa ma vaa zu, naama walii ɠa ɠula masagi ná-naavolo makɛsuʋɛ.<verse eid="EZR 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21"/>«Nɔ̀un nà, masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse, gè devei vea naavolo makɛ nuiti kpein zea, ti ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei, ga ti naa kpein kɛ ga pagɔ, nii zalaɠa ɠula nui Ɛsedalase bosu ti ma, geeɠɔlɔgi zu ƓALAGI ná-tɔgiti ma ɠalamɔin. <verse eid="EZR 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22"/>Ti maanɛɛʋɛ ti kilo waasaʋagɔ (3.000) ɠɛɠala ve zea ga walii, moloi kilo waaʋuusaʋagɔ (30.000) ɠɛɠala, dɔɔi litɛlɛ waanaanigɔ (4.000) ɠɛɠala, gulɔi litɛlɛ waanaanigɔ (4.000) ɠɛɠala, ti kpoloi ve zea, ʋelei nɛai la ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZR 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23"/>Devei kpein geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛ ƓALAGI feezu, sei ʋɛlɛi ma vaa zu, ti pɛ ge ɠɛ ga kɛɛʋelei, nii a kɛ GALAGI naa mina ʋa yiiɠaawanazu masa zooi ma, ɓaa nà ɓɔɠɔi ma gá màvofodaiti. <verse eid="EZR 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24"/>Gá bosu ɓalaa naavolo makɛ nuiti kpein ma ga nu mina zou zalai, ɓaa maazoloo ganii, ɓaa zou maaleʋe salai ɠula zalaɠa ɠula nuiti zea, ta Levi nuiti, ta guye loo nuiti, é ʋɛɛ siɠida makɛ nuiti ba, ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ nuiti kpein ba ti botii ɠɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="EZR 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25"/>«Ɛsedalase, ɗa ma, ʋelei ɗa-ƓALAGI ɠigi veai la è ya, faawo bo nuiti ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti sei ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei nuɓusɛiti saama, ti ɗa tukpɔɠaaleʋe naati bɛ, ti ɗa-ƓALAGI ná-tɔgiti kwɛɛ. Wa ti lɛɛ ga naati ɓalaa, niiti ti la ti ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="EZR 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é la kɛɛni é ʋa ɗa-ƓALAGI ná-tɔgiti ta masagi ná-tɔgiti so ga pagɔ, naama nui maanɛɛʋɛ ga é za, ɓaa ti kula zooi ʋa, ɓaa kɔligiti ti ɠula zea, ɓaa é ʋili kasoi ɠa.»<verse eid="EZR 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maamusɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ade-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI, nii é puai masagi yiima ga é nii ɠɛɠala lɛbiyai ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ʋɛ Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZR 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28"/>Tɔ ɠa é wooɠɛɠiladai ɠɛa bɛ̀, é ɠaazu unfe fe bɛ̀ gi yɔɠɔzu gá masagi, ta ná-tɛnɛbo nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ ná-tosuba nu wolaiti kpein ba. Tɛi gè kwɛɛni ga toɠa bà, naa ìɲɔdɔɔni, gè zoo gè Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti gaalɛ ba, ga gi lɛ ʋɔɔma Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="EZR 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛsedalase ziɛɲɔɠɔiti daaseigiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1"/>Pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti daaseigiti kaa, niiti gi lɛɛni ʋɔɔma ga tiye, gi zeɠe Ɓaɓilɔne, gi li Zeluzalɛme, masagi Aaletazɛɛlesɛse ná-siɛgi zu.<verse eid="EZR 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2"/>Fineyase mavofodaiti: Gɛɛlɛsome.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">Itamaal mavofodaiti: Daniyɛle.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">Davide mavofodaiti: Ɠatuse.<verse eid="EZR 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3"/>Sekania ta Paleyɔse ti-mavofodaiti: Zakali, nii é ɠɛni nu ungila nu ʋuulɔɔlu (150) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4"/>Paɠate-Moaɓe mavofodaiti: Eliyɔyenayi, Zelayia ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu unfelegɔ (200) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5"/>Zatu mavofodaiti: Sekania, Yaɠaziyɛle ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu unsaʋagɔ (300) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6"/>Adin mavofodaiti: Eɓɛde, Zonatan ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7"/>Elame mavofodaiti: Ezayi, Atalia ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu ʋuulɔfela (70) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8"/>Sefatia mavofodaiti: Zeɓadia, Mikayɛle ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu ʋuulɔsaʋa (80) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9"/>Zoaɓe mavofodaiti: Aɓediyase, Yeɠiyɛle ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu unfelegɔ nu puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (218) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10"/>Selomite mavofodaiti: Yosifiya ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu ungila nu ʋuulɔzita (160) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11"/>Ɓeɓayi mavofodaiti: Zakali, Ɓeɓayi ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (28) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12"/>Azagade mavofodaiti: Yoɠanan, Ɠakatan ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni nu ungila nu puugɔ (110) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13"/>Adonikame mavofodaiti: gaaɓelagiti niiti ti-laaseigiti ti ɠɛni ga Elifelɛte, Yeiyɛle, ta Semaya, naati ti ɠɛni nu ʋuulɔzita (60) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14"/>Ɓigivayi mavofodaiti: Utayi ta Zakuul, niiti ti ɠɛni nu ʋuulɔfela (70) unda.<verse eid="EZR 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme ziɛi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15"/>Gè niima nuiti kpein gaalɛɛni ba ziɛ wolai ɠobaʋɛ, nii é yeizu ga Aɠava ʋele, gi yɛni miná folo saʋagɔ laawu. Gè wɛlɛni nuɓusɛiti saama ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, gè la Levi nu nɔpɛ kaani ti zu. <verse eid="EZR 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16"/>Názu ɠa gè kundiɠii niiti tolini la: Eliyezɛɛl, Aliyɛle, Semaya, Ɛlɛnatan, Yaliɓe, Natan, Zakali, ta Mesulame, naa ʋɛɛ tɔ kalamɔn felegɔiti ba Yoyaliɓe ta Ɛlɛnatan. <verse eid="EZR 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17"/>Gè valini ti ma ga ti li Kasifia ɠundiɠii Ido ʋɔ bɛ, gè wooi ʋu ti-la, nii ta bo Ido ma, ta kɛɛɠɛlointi pɛ, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiɠɛ nuiti niiti ti Kasifia, ga ti kpɔba nuiti teʋe gi ma, gá-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi vai zu. <verse eid="EZR 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18"/>Tɛi gá-ƓALAGI ma ge ɠɛni gi ʋa, é ɗa gi ɠaazumaawɔinɠa, ti Seleɓia leʋeni gi ma, nu ɠɛni de ɠigi ma, Maali ná-bolodai zu, Levi mavofodai zu, Izilayɛle ná-doun zunui, ti nu puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18) ʋɛɛni ba kɛɛɠɛlointi saama, ta ná-doun zunuiti, <verse eid="EZR 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19"/>é ʋɛɛ Ɠasaɓiya ta Ezayi ʋa, ti ɠɛ Melali mavofodaiti, ta kɛɛɠɛlointi, é ʋɛɛ ti-loun zunuiti ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu ʋuufelegɔ (20). <verse eid="EZR 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20"/>Ti ʋaani ɓalaa ga nu unfelegɔ nu ʋuufelegɔ (220), niiti Davide ta pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti ti yeeloni ti pɛ ba ga ti-laaseigiti, ti ti ve Levi nuiti zea, ga ti ɗa botii ɠɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="EZR 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21"/>Gi yɛni miná ziɛ wolai ɠobaʋɛ, nii é yeizu ga Aɠava ʋele, gè deve ga gi zugi zo, naa ɠɛ ga gá-ɓɔɠɔmaayeii ma ʋoogi gá-ƓALAGI ʋɛ, nii a kɛ gi siɛ ʋagɔ wo ziilɛigi zu, gá gá-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, ta gi-ɠɔligiti. <verse eid="EZR 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22"/>Nà la ɠɛɛna masagi ma, é salaʋusuiti ta soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti fe, ti gi makɛ gi zili nuiti daalɔɠɔma, naa ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ga unfe faa zèa, tɔɔzei gi dɛɛni la ga, gá-ƓALAGI ɠa ɗa naati makɛ, niiti ti bɛ ga wooɠɛɠila nuiti, kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa yiiɠaawana gola naati ma, ti ɠɛlɛzu tɔun ba. <verse eid="EZR 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23"/>Naa maaʋele ma, gi zugi zoni, gi gá-ƓALAGI maanɛɛnɛni ga é ɓaa gi maazu, tama é gi wooɠaaʋoteni.<verse eid="EZR 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24"/>Naa ʋoluma gè zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) lolini, ta Seleɓia, naa ʋɛɛ Ɠasaɓiya ʋa, ta ti-ɠɛɛloun puugɔ. <verse eid="EZR 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25"/>Gè walii ta zanugi ɠɔɠɔni, gè pɛɛ sɔɔla ɓiigiti kpein ba niiti masagi ta ná-tɛnɛbo nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti ba, ta Izilayɛle nuiti ti ná-zooi zu, ti kpɔni ba gá-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi vai zu, gè fe ti ya. <verse eid="EZR 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26"/>Gè kilo waaʋuufelegɔ (20.000) veeni ti ya ga walii, gè kilo waasaʋagɔ (3.000) ve ti ya ga ani ɓiigiti ti ɓɛtɛai ga walii, gè kilo waasaʋagɔ (3.000) ve ti ya ga zanugi, <verse eid="EZR 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27"/>gè zanu ɗaawɔ ʋuufelegɔ (20) ve ti ya, nii a la zeeli zanu kae waagila (1.000) su, ta kɔlu ɓɔi aniɲaka ʋapa felegɔ, ti ʋagai ga zanugi ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="EZR 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28"/>Gè ɠɛni ti ma: «Ʋelei wo veai la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ʋele ɠana niima zɔɔlaiti feai la. Walii ta zanugi ta ga vebɛaniiti, niiti ti ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wo-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="EZR 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29"/>À ɓaa ti maazu ga pagɔ, eyɛsu wo zeeli Zeluzalɛme, názu wa ti pɛ gaalu niina, wo ti ve zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolaiti zea, ta Levi nuiti, é ʋɛɛ pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti ba, wo ti ʋu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ʋɛɛbagoiti bu.» <verse eid="EZR 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta Levi nuiti ti walii ta zanugiti seɠeni, é ʋɛɛ sɔɔlai zɔiti ba, ti li ga tiye Zeluzalɛme, gá-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="EZR 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siɛi wo pelei, <optbreak/> ta ti zeeli ʋelei Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31"/>Alu mɔungi ma volo puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ma, gi zeɠeni ziɛ wolai ɠobaʋɛ, nii é yeizu ga Aɠava ʋele, gi li Zeluzalɛme. Eyɛsu gi zeeli, gá-ƓALAGI yeeyɛni gi ʋa, é ɗa ɓaa gi maazu gi zili nuiti ta toosu nuiti daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti ɠɛni gi maaluazu. <verse eid="EZR 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32"/>Gi zeeliai ma Zeluzalɛme, gi looɠoni folo saʋagɔ laawu. <verse eid="EZR 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33"/>Foloi naanisiɛi, gi walii, ta zanugi, ta sɔɔla ɓiigiti gaaluni gá-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, gi ti ve zalaɠa ɠula nui Melemɔte ya, Ilii ná-doun zunui, ta Fineyase ná-doun zunui Eleazaal. Levi nui niiti ti ɠɛni ti ɠoba, ti-laaseigiti kaa: Zozuwe ná-doun zunui Yozaɓade, ta Ɓinuwi ná-doun zunui Noadia. <verse eid="EZR 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34"/>Ti gaaluni, é ɠɔɠɔ, buɲɛgi ɓɔgai pɛ ge zɛʋɛni sɛʋɛi zu.<verse eid="EZR 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35"/>Niiti kpein ti duɔlai ɠɛɛni, ti ɠale ma, naati ti zalaɠaiti kulani Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ʋɛ ga: nikɛ zinɛ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12), Izilayɛle nuiti kpein bɛ. Ti baala sinɛ ʋuutaaʋuugɔ maazu lɔzita (96), ta baala ziʋo ʋuulɔfela maazu lɔfela (77) ɠulani gala zalaɠaiti faa zu, ta boli zinɛ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ga koto gba zalaɠai. Togani naati kpein ti ɠalani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="EZR 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36"/>Naa ʋoluma ti masagi ná-sɛʋɛi zu wooi laazeelini ná-nu wolaiti ma, ta zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti ma, ti zeini ziɛ wolai Efelate folo liizu ʋelei. Naati ti tɔnɔ ma ɓɔbai ɠɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu.<verse eid="EZR 8:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9"/>
  <para style="s">Wɛɛn anzanuiti fulu vai <optbreak/> Izilayɛle nui ma mɔinmɔin bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1"/>Niima vaiti poluma, kundiɠii tanigaa ti maaɓuɠani bà, ti ɠɛ mà: «Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti, ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Levi nuiti ba, ti la maaɠoozani zooi nii zu nuɓusɛiti ba, ti la kɛɛni ti ʋa zeɠe zii niiti ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti polu: Kanaan nuiti, Ɠɛte nuiti, Felɛze nuiti, Yeɓuse nuiti, Amɔn nuiti, Moaɓe nuiti, Ezipete nuiti, ta Amool nuiti. <verse eid="EZR 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti naati ti-loun anzanuiti fuluʋɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ta ti-loun zunuiti bɛ, ti zii ɲadegai zupua ga zooi nii zu nuɓusɛiti. Zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠiiti ta kundiɠiiti ka ti ɠɛa ga nu mɔungiti ti siɛ ʋele ɲɔi ɠɛ.»<verse eid="EZR 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3"/>Gè naa mɛnigai ma, gè nà-seɠeiti ta nà-seɠe maazu zeɠei ʋalini ga, gè ɗa nɔ̀undeɠaiti ta kpɛ̀lɛi volofolo ma kidaaʋiligi maaʋele ma, gè zei gaazuɠilii zu. <verse eid="EZR 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4"/>Gè yɛni zeini ná eyɛsu kpɔkɔ zalaɠa ɠula ziɛgi zeeli. Niiti kpein ti ɠɛni luazu Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ná-tukpɔi ʋa, naama nuiti ta-ɠɛɛwoti ɲɔiti daalɔɠɔma, ti ɠulaai duɔlai zu, naati ti ʋaani, ti zei kòba. <verse eid="EZR 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5"/>Kpɔkɔ zalaɠa ɠula ziɛgi zu, gè wuzeɠeni, gè ɠula nà-gaazuɠilii zu, nà-seɠeiti ta nà-seɠe maazu zeɠei ʋaliai ga, gè ʋilɛni ɲìibiɠa, gè yeemaale nà-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, <verse eid="EZR 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6"/>gè maanɛɛnɛ ɠani: «Nà-GALAGI, niima unfe kaa le! Ee, nà-GALAGI, nà unfesu vɔlɔ ga gè ʋa ɠaazuwuzeɠe, gè wɛlɛ è ʋa. Mazɔlɔɔ gá-vaaɠaaza golaiti ti wola mɔinɗa, ti gi maaɓɔlea, gi-zɔgiti ti ɠaaɠooza, ti zei geeɠɔlɔgi ʋa. <verse eid="EZR 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7"/>É zo gi-ɠɛɛni ta-voloiti ma, é zeeli za ma, gá ga sɔba nuiti nɔ, gá-vaaɠaaza golaiti maaʋele ɠa é kɛa, gá-o, gá-masagiti-yo, gá-zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, è gi lɔa la zii ɠiligiti ta-masagiti zea, è gi ve boɠa zɔkpɔi ta duɔlai ya, gi ɠɛ toomai ta unfegi laawu, eɠɛʋelei é la za. <verse eid="EZR 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8"/>Kɛlɛ niima ziɛgi zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gá-ƓALAGI, è undaanɛ ɠɛa gi ʋɛ yeeɠɛɠala go laawu, ga nui tanigaa ti yɛ vulua gi zaama, ti ɠale ma, ti ʋa, ti zei ɗa-you ɲadegai zu, è gi-ɠaazuʋɛti seɠea ma, ti volo, è zɛnvu go ve gi ʋɛ ga luɔlai zaama. <verse eid="EZR 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9"/>Gi ɠɛa duɔlai zu, kɛlɛ è la ɠɛlɛni gi ʋa. È Pɛɛlese masagiti gaazu ʋagɔ logɛ gi ʋa, ti vaaʋɛ bu ga ti gi-yɛnvui yɛ gi ya, nii a kɛ gi gá-ƓALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo ʋolu, ta gi koloɠolosuʋɛti buzeɠe ʋolu, ta gi lɔɔɠuzu ʋagɔ zɔlɔɔ Zuda ta Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="EZR 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10"/>«Kɛlɛ lee ɠa gá bo niina naa pɛ poluma, ee, gá-ƓALAGI! Mazɔlɔɔ gi ɠɛlɛa ɗa-lɔgiti ba, <verse eid="EZR 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11"/>niiti è ti veai gi ya ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti maaʋele, GALA goo wo nuiti, è ɠɛni gi ma: ‹Zooi nii wo ʋaazu sɔlɔɔsu, kɔzɔʋɛ, tɔɔzei zii niiti ti zeini su ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, tama ti sulaavegɛ ga ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti eyɛsu é zeeli kwɛgi pɛ ma. <verse eid="EZR 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à mina wo-loun anzanuiti fe ti-loun zunuiti bɛ ga anza, à mina ti-loun anzanuiti fulu wo-loun zunuiti bɛ ga anza, à mina yiizoolɛ ga ta-yiilɛigi ta ta-undaanɛɛi ma vaa, naazu wa zɛbɛi zɔlɔɔ, wo ɗa zooi ʋaalɔnɔ pagɔiti mi, wo ma zooi yɛ wo-lointi zea ga poganii eyɛsu ɠɔ.› <verse eid="EZR 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13"/>Nii kpein seeliai gi ma, naa ɠulaʋɛ gá-ɠotoiti ta gi-zɔ ɲɔu wolaiti su, kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, è la gi zoni ga ʋelei soloogai la gá-vaaɠaaza golaiti ma, è vaaʋɛ bu ga è gi-mɔta goi yɛ ná. <verse eid="EZR 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14"/>Leeni vaa zu gá li ɗa-lɔgiti koloɠolosu ʋolu, ga gi ɗa vului ɠɛ yɔɠɔzu gá zii niiti ti kɔzɔba vaiti kɛɛzu? È la yiiɠaawana gi ma naazu ɓaa, é ʋa gi pɛ suwuɠaaleʋe, kulaba la ba? <verse eid="EZR 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15"/>Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è lelebogɛ, naa ɠa é kɛa, è gi mɔta goi gi yɛ ga vulua za, wɛlɛ gi ʋa è ɠakala ga gá-ɠotoiti, tama niima ɠɛʋelei nii zu, gi la zooga losu kpaan è ɠakala.»<verse eid="EZR 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti ti minazeɠe vai ga <optbreak/> ti ɠolo GALA bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1"/>Siɛgi zu Ɛsedalase laaʋɛa ɠɛni de zooi ma, é ɗa wɔlɔ, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, é ɗa niima ƓALA falii ta tosɔgai nii ɠɛ, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛi ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠaalɛɛni ba koba, zunuiti ta anzanuiti ta doungoiti, ti ɗa wɔlɔ ga gola. <verse eid="EZR 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2"/>Naazu Yeɠiyɛle ná-doun zunui Sekania, é ga Elame mavofodai ta, naa ɠɛni Ɛsedalase ma: «Gi ɠɛa ga wooʋalada nuiti gá-ƓALAGI ʋɛ, ga gi lii vai gi wɛɛn anzanuiti fulu zii ɠiligiti saama, niiti ti zooi nii zu. Kɛlɛ kito ko ɠa dɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛ niima vai zu. <verse eid="EZR 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3"/>Ade minazeɠe niina ada-ƓALAGI ʋɛ ga ada wɛɛn anzanui niiti kpɛɛ ta ti-lointi, eɠɛʋelei màliɠii Ɛsedalase ná-tɛnɛgi la, ta niiti kpein ti ada-ƓALAGI ná-deveiti sosu. Ade ná-tɔgiti so kpaan. <verse eid="EZR 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4"/>Wuzeɠe, tɔɔzei ɗa ɠa ɗa niima vai ɠaaɠula ba. Kɛlɛ gá yɛsu è ʋa, zɛbɛzeɠe, è kɛ!»<verse eid="EZR 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5"/>Ɛsedalase wuzeɠeni, é kpɛɛlagi la zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti bu, ta Levi geleiti, ta Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ, ga ti ɠona ga ta naa ɠɛ, nii ti bogai. Ti pɛ ti ɠonani. <verse eid="EZR 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6"/>Naa ʋoluma Ɛsedalase zeɠeni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, é li Eliasiɓe ná-doun zunui Yoɠanan laazuʋɛ, é ɲi ná, kɛlɛ é ɠɛlɛni daamianigi pɛ ba ta kpɔle aniiti pɛ, mazɔlɔɔ é ɠɛni wɔlɔzu Izilayɛle luɔ wɔlɔmaiti ta-ɠoto wolaiti faa zu.<verse eid="EZR 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duɔ wɔlɔmaiti ta-ɠaalɛba vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7"/>Ti sɛʋɛi leʋeni názu Zuda yooi zu ná pɛ ta Zeluzalɛme, ga niiti kpein ti ɠɛa duɔlai zu, ti ɠalegai ma, ti ɠaalɛ ba Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="EZR 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8"/>Kundiɠiiti ta totuɠɔiti ti deveni ga zɔi nɔpɛ é la ʋaani folo saʋagɔ laawu, kɔligiti ta ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa ɠula naati saama, ti ɠulaai duɔlai zu.<verse eid="EZR 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9"/>Zuda ta Ɓɛnzamɛn zunuiti kpein ti ɠaalɛɛni ba Zeluzalɛme folo saʋagɔ laawu. Naa ɠɛɛni alugi laaʋuusiɛi ma volo ʋuufelegɔi (20) ma. Nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠɛni zeini GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, ti ɗa ɓali, tɔɔzei naama vai ʋa ti ɠɛni su, ta tonai é ɠɛni ʋuuzu ga sabalagi. <verse eid="EZR 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Ɛsedalase wuzeɠeni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wooʋaladai ɠa wo kɛai ga wo wɛɛn anzanuiti fulu vai, wo ta ɓɔga Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠoto ɠasɔi ʋa. <verse eid="EZR 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11"/>À laa zɔ ga niina Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wo-ɠɛɛni ta-ƓALAGI, wo ziima vai ɠɛ, à bali ma wa zooi nii zu nuɓusɛiti, ta wɛɛn anzanuiti.»<verse eid="EZR 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12"/>Nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti gooɠaaʋoteni ga woo wola, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi-yee ɠa bu! Gá naa ɠɛ, nii è bogai! <verse eid="EZR 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13"/>Kɛlɛ nuɓusɛi mɔinʋɛ, tonai ɠaa é ʋuuzu, nu la zooga yɛsu eteaʋɛ, niima vai mu ge la vɔlɔ ga folo ɠila ɓaa folo felegɔ vaa nɔ, mazɔlɔɔ gi ma mɔinmɔin, gi tɔ koloɠologi ɠɛɛʋɛ niima vai zu. <verse eid="EZR 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14"/>Gá pɔ ga gá-ɠundiɠiiti ti yɛ nuɓusɛi yeema, zɔiti kpein ti wɛɛn anzanuiti fuluai, naati ti ɗa ʋa ti ʋɔ ta ta-laa ɠundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ba, kui naa ma, nii togai ti ʋɛ, ga niima vai ɠaaɠulazu ba ga pagɔ eyɛsu gá-ƓALAGI ná-ziiɠaawana wolai zeɠe gi maala.» <verse eid="EZR 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15"/>Azayɛle ná-doun zunui Zonatan, ta Tikava ná-doun zunui Yaziya, naa ʋɛɛ Mesulame ʋa ta Levi nui Saɓetayi, naati gila kpe nɔ ɠa ti ɠɛlɛni naa ma levei ʋa.<verse eid="EZR 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16"/>Izilayɛle nuiti niiti ti ɠulani duɔlai zu, naati pɛ ti vaani bu. Zalaɠa ɠula nui Ɛsedalase yiimazeɠeni pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti pɛlɛyeɠeiti kpein saama, é yeeloni ti ɠilagilagi kpein ba. Ti ta-zei lɔɔzeini alugi ʋuusiɛi ma volo mɔungi ma nii a kɛ ti niima vai wuuʋɛtɛ. <verse eid="EZR 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17"/>Alu mɔungi ma volo mɔungi, ti ɓeni ga zunuiti kpein ta-vaiti gaaɠula ba, niiti ti wɛɛn anzanuiti fuluni.<verse eid="EZR 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔba nuiti daaseigiti</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti-mavofodaiti saama, tanigaa ti wɛɛn anzanuiti fuluni, naama nuiti daaseigiti ka ga nii:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:18">Yosadake ná-doun zunui Zozuwe mavofodaiti saama, ta kɛɛɠɛlointi: Maaseya, Eliyezɛɛl, Yaliɓe, ta Gedalia. <verse eid="EZR 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19"/>Ti minazeɠeni, ti ɠona ga ta ti-anzaiti kpɛɛzu, naa ʋolu ti baala sinɛ ɠilagila kula ga faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai ta-ɠotoi ma zuvaayɛ fai zu.<verse eid="EZR 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20"/>Niiti ti ɠɛni Imɛɛl mavofodaiti saama, ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:20">Ɠanani ta Zeɓadia.<verse eid="EZR 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21"/>Niiti ti ɠɛni Ɠalime mavofodaiti saama, ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:21">Maaseya, Eli, Semaya, Yeɠiyɛle ta Woziase.<verse eid="EZR 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22"/>Niiti ti ɠɛni Pasuul mavofodaiti saama, ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:22">Eliyɔyenayi, Maaseya, Isemayɛle, Netaneyɛle, Yozaɓade ta Eleyasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23"/>Niiti ti ɠɛni Levi nuiti saama, ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:23">Yozaɓade, Simeyi, Kelaya é lolisu ɓalaa ga Kelita, Petayia, Zuda ta Eliyezɛɛl.<verse eid="EZR 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24"/>Nii é ɠɛni gɛingɛin gani nuiti saama, naa ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Eliasiɓe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 10:24"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:24">Niiti ti ɠɛni siɠida makɛ nuiti saama, ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Salume, Telɛme ta Uli.<verse eid="EZR 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25"/>Niiti ti ɠɛni Izilayɛle nui mɔtaiti saama, ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:25">Paleyɔse mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:25">Lamia, Yiziya, Malikiya, Miyamine, Eleazaal, Malikiya ta Ɓenaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26"/>Elame mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:26">Matania, Zakali, Yeɠiyɛle, Aɓidi, Yelemɔte ta Eli.<verse eid="EZR 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27"/>Zatu mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:27">Eliyɔyenayi, Eliasiɓe, Matania, Yelemɔte, Zaɓade ta Aziza.<verse eid="EZR 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28"/>Ɓeɓayi mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:28">Yoɠanan, Ɠanania, Zaɓayi ta Atalayi.<verse eid="EZR 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29"/>Ɓani mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:29">Mesulame, Maluke, Adaya, Yasuɓe, Seyale ta Lamɔte.<verse eid="EZR 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30"/>Paɠate-Moaɓe mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:30">Adana, Kelale, Ɓenaya, Maaseya, Matania, Ɓɛsaleyɛle, Ɓinuwi ta Manasé.<verse eid="EZR 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31"/>Ɠalime mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:31">Eliyezɛɛl, Yisiya, Malikiya, Semaya, Simiyɔn, <verse eid="EZR 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn, Maluke ta Semalia.<verse eid="EZR 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33"/>Ɠasume mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:33">Matenayi, Matata, Zaɓade, Elifelɛte, Yelemayi, Manasé ta Simeyi.<verse eid="EZR 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34"/>Ɓani mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:34">Maadayi, Amalame, Uwɛle <verse eid="EZR 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35"/>Ɓenaya, Ɓedia, Keluɠu, <verse eid="EZR 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36"/>Vania, Melemɔte, Eliasiɓe, <verse eid="EZR 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37"/>Matania, Matenayi, Yaasayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38"/>Ɓani, Ɓinuwi, Simeyi, <verse eid="EZR 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39"/>Selemiya, Natan, Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40"/>Makenadebayi, Sasayi, Salayi, <verse eid="EZR 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41"/>Azalɛle, Selemiya, Semalia, <verse eid="EZR 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42"/>Salume, Amalia ta Zozɛfe.<verse eid="EZR 10:42"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43"/>Neɓo mavofodai zu geleiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:43">Yeiyɛle, Matitia, Zaɓade, Zeɓina, Yadayi, Zowɛle ta Ɓenaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44"/>Zunui niiti pɛ ti wɛɛn anzanuiti fuluni, ma mɔinmɔingaa ti doun zɔlɔɔ ti ʋa.<verse eid="EZR 10:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10"/>
</usx>
